   "title": "Home",
   "content": "<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"{{media:hero}}\",\"id\":{{media_id:hero}},\"dimRatio\":20,\"minHeight\":640,\"contentPosition\":\"center left\",\"align\":\"full\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull has-custom-content-position is-position-center-left\" style=\"min-height:640px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-20 has-background-dim\"></span><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-{{media_id:hero}}\" alt=\"\" src=\"{{media:hero}}\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tl-kicker\"} --><p class=\"tl-kicker\">The autumn edit</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clothes made<br>to be lived in.</h1><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Natural fibres, honest prices and pieces you will reach for every week.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/shop/\">Shop the collection</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div><!-- /wp:cover --><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tl-section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center tl-section-title\">Shop by category</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tl-cats\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tl-cats\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:cat-women}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/product-category/women/\"><img src=\"{{media:cat-women}}\" alt=\"Women collection\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:cat-women}}\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Women</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:cat-men}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/product-category/men/\"><img src=\"{{media:cat-men}}\" alt=\"Men collection\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:cat-men}}\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Men</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:cat-accessories}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/product-category/accessories/\"><img src=\"{{media:cat-accessories}}\" alt=\"Accessories collection\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:cat-accessories}}\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Accessories</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:cat-shoes}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/product-category/shoes/\"><img src=\"{{media:cat-shoes}}\" alt=\"Shoes collection\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:cat-shoes}}\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Shoes</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tl-section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center tl-section-title\">Featured pieces</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[products limit=\"8\" columns=\"4\" visibility=\"featured\"]<!-- /wp:shortcode --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tl-banner\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tl-banner\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10% off your first order</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Use the code <strong>WELCOME10</strong> at checkout. Free shipping on orders over $75.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tl-section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center tl-section-title\">On sale now</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[products limit=\"4\" columns=\"4\" on_sale=\"true\"]<!-- /wp:shortcode --><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tl-section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center tl-section-title\">New arrivals</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[products limit=\"8\" columns=\"4\" orderby=\"date\" order=\"DESC\"]<!-- /wp:shortcode -->",
   "template": "page-home",
